//= 1.7 Fixed exploits [Lupus] 1.8 Removed Duplicates [Silent]
//= 1.9 Fixed a bunch of typos with information from Crono/Hollengrhen [Evera]
//= 1.9a Now Pavianne doesn't sell Kafra Passes. She refunds them [Lupus]
